<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">FineQuest: Adaptive Knowledge-Assisted Sports Video Understanding via Agent-of-Thoughts Reasoning</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Proceedings of the 33rd ACM International Conference on Multimedia; October 27–31, 2025; Dublin, Ireland</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">Proceedings of the 33rd ACM International Conference on Multimedia (MM ’25), October 27–31, 2025, Dublin, Ireland</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3746027.3754885">10.1145/3746027.3754885</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-2035-2/2025/10</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Computer vision</span></span></span>
